 2. Call the verifier MCP tool restart_app exactly once, wait for its completed restart, then open a fresh browser page at http://localhost:3000. A browser reload alone is insufficient.
-3. The recorded library identities/titles remain exactly once each, with no resurrected QC Restart Deleted. Primary and Copy load with their own exact saved filenames, source and revisions. Run each and observe its matching console marker.
